use math

note: CRATE CLIMBER - climb the tiers to the star while barrels roll down at you.
note: Left and right walk. Up and down climb a ladder. Space jumps (hop over the barrels!).

make a sprite called climber with pixel size 2 and 2 frames
    where "y" is yellow and "s" is skin and "b" is blue and "k" is brown
